
===== PARTNER VERDICT (codex, 975s) =====

Implemented S2 interactive drills in [src/App.tsx](z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/src/App.tsx:1042) and updated `ja-lesson-1` in [content/ja/lessons.ts](z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/content/ja/lessons.ts:34). Roadmap lesson nodes now show `N steps` instead of `0 of 1 lessons`.

Components added:
- `MatchActivity`
- `ListenActivity`
- `BuildActivity`
- `FillActivity`

`ja-lesson-1` step order is now:
`intro → vocab → match → grammar → grammar → listen → build → scene → reading → fill → check`

Activity sourcing:
- `match`: uses `step.lexOrders`, falling back to `lesson.newLexOrders`; shuffles English gloss column.
- `listen`: uses `step.lexOrders` for audio target; distractors come from lesson/nearby lexicon glosses. It also supports sentence-backed `sceneId` fallback.
- `build`: uses the referenced `sceneId` first eligible scene line, shuffles its `tokens[]`, checks against original token order.
- `fill`: uses the referenced `sceneId` line, blanks one non-particle lexical token, distractors from other non-particle lexicon headwords.

Verification:
- `npx tsc -b`: rc 0
- `npm run lint:content`: rc 0
- `npm run build`: rc 0, with existing Vite chunk-size warning
- `npm test`: rc 0, 38 tests passed

I did not edit `vite.config.ts`, run preview, deploy, or commit.

